  "about": {
    "title": "About the Dragon Majesty set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Dragon Majesty is a Sun & Moon expansion released on 7 September 2018. It has 78 cards: 70 in the main set and 8 secret rares. There are also 56 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 70 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (126 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 134 cards, adding the 8 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
